# steps/named-struct-exec.md §12: unit_named_struct_exec_block_field under the knob --walk-methods: the
# walked procedure reaches the block through its occurrence, not through its data, the Structure (a
# holder that is the running code reads as the data).  n 5, twin 5.  Entry 7.
Counter:
    size_t: n 0U
    if: n = 0U
        size_t: t 5U
        n: n + t
return
fn: twin () size_t
    size_t: n 0U
    if: n = 0U
        size_t: t 5U
        n: n + t
return: n
Counter
size_t: a 9U
a: Counter\n
Counter
size_t: b 9U
b: twin()
int: ok 0
if: a = 5U && Counter\n = 5U && b = 5U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
